{"id":"f985ced977f087d9","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-hintikka-characterization.md","title":"Hintikka set / Model Existence Theorem","display":"thm-hintikka-characterization — Hintikka set / Model Existence Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-hintikka-characterization","aliases":["57-thm-hintikka-characterization"],"display":"thm-hintikka-characterization — Hintikka set / Model Existence Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-hintikka-formula]]","[[57-df-model]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-subformula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-hintikka-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-hintikka-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hintikka-characterization — Hintikka set / Model Existence Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"807d3e2825b947af\" href=\"?note=807d3e2825b947af\" title=\"57-df-hintikka-formula\">57-df-hintikka-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4377db68f8b53b52\" href=\"?note=4377db68f8b53b52\" title=\"57-df-model\">57-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" href=\"?note=c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" title=\"57-df-subformula\">57-df-subformula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为固定语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\emptyset\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\in\\mathrm{Hintikka}\">\\(\\Theta\\in\\mathrm{Hintikka}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"807d3e2825b947af\" href=\"?note=807d3e2825b947af\" title=\"57-df-hintikka-formula\">57-df-hintikka-formula</a> 的原四条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathrm{NNF}_S\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathrm{NNF}_S\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，且其中出现的所有原子子公式均为关系原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(\\vec t)\">\\(R(\\vec t)\\)</span>，不出现等号原子；因此它们是无量词、闭的、无等号的否定范式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sf}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sf}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" href=\"?note=c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" title=\"57-df-subformula\">57-df-subformula</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\quad\\mathfrak A\\models\\Theta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\quad\\mathfrak A\\models\\Theta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原四个 Hintikka 条件不足以保证任意一阶集合有模型。本结论限于这些条件确实控制的闭无等号片段；不通过加强 Hintikka 定义改变原谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-hintikka-formula","status":"resolved","id":"807d3e2825b947af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on",